-- The renderer's own words, in a document in another language.

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is large` @nlg:en the amount %amount% is large
                  @nlg:he %amount% עולה על הסף
  IF amount GREATER THAN 100

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`large or not` MEANS `is large` amount OR NOT `is large` amount

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@nlg:en the threshold is passed
@nlg:he הסף נחצה
`passed` MEANS n > 1

`uses it` MEANS `passed` 5
